OL,3,ABBC secret filming shows dog breeder
OL,4,Aselling sick puppies for #2k each
OL,5,
OL,6,FA BBC investigation has found the
OL,7,Fbreeder had been stripped of his
OL,8,Ffive-star rating two months before
OL,9,Fselling several sick puppies, but
OL,10,Fcontinued to advertise as five-star.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
